    "Did you ever use AI to support your math learning in the last year? If yes, how was your experience?": "Not directly with math tools, but I used voice assistants for organization and general problem-solving tasks. For math, I’d prefer peer study groups or tutors over AI—it’s easier to ask a human about intuition than just plugging numbers into an equation. The last year hasn’t been ideal for tech use (school cuts costs), so I’ve mostly relied on textbooks.",
